      "content": "idk the er is just so expensive and honestly i feel like i know my body... it literally happened right when i lifted the box so it has to be my back. i dont have a fever or anything like that. is it really that bad? can i just try a high dose of ibuprofen and some heat pads for tonight and see if it gets better by morning?",
